      "html": "\n<div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">量能台阶 <span class=\"hint\">机器核对 · 米开换算表(手册V2 §2.3) · 温度表权威</span></h3><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step dim\"><span class=\"sr\">≥3.8</span><span class=\"sn\">主升2确认<small>放量突破</small></span><span class=\"sd\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"step dim\"><span class=\"sr\">3.5~3.8</span><span class=\"sn\">突破压力<small>需增量</small></span><span class=\"sd\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"step dim\"><span class=\"sr\">3.3~3.5</span><span class=\"sn\">强修<small>量能承接</small></span><span class=\"sd\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"step dim\"><span class=\"sr\">3.0~3.3</span><span class=\"sn\">过渡<small>量能中枢</small></span><span class=\"sd\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"step cur\"><span class=\"sr\"><3.0</span><span class=\"sn\">弱修<small>缩量分歧</small></span><span class=\"sd\"><span class=\"dayc\">09-09 1.86</span><span class=\"dayc\">09-10 1.97</span><span class=\"dayc now\">09-11 1.97</span></span></div>\n</div><div class=\"hint\">量能 1.97 万亿落\"弱修\"档 —— 米开量能台阶换算(手册V2 §2.3 A档, 腾讯替代源); 当日涨停40/温度12.7(冰点), 档位与温度档冰点联动判读。</div></div>\n\n",
